- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `no_trailing_whitespace_in_string` .[decision-facts]


